* Structure with punctuation
:PROPERTIES:
:CUSTOM_ID: structure-main
:END:
Literal punctuation: <br> & [square] (round) *star*.

First hard break\\\\
Second line.

#+BEGIN_QUOTE
Quoted first line.
Quoted second line.
#+END_QUOTE

#+BEGIN_VERSE
Verse first line
Verse second line
#+END_VERSE

- [ ] unchecked task
- [X] checked task
  - Nested item
1. Ordered first
2. Ordered second

| Cell | Content |
|------+---------|
| Pipe | left\\|right |
| Break | first\\\\| second |

Footnote reference[fn:policy] and again[fn:policy].

* Duplicate slug
Second heading body.

* Duplicate slug
Third heading body.

[fn:policy] Footnote definition with `code`.
