   "#+OPTIONS: toc:nil num:nil
#+LINK: docs https://example.test/documentation/%s

* Render branches!

Anchor <<plain-target>> and radio <<<radio phrase>>>. [[Render branches!]] [[radio phrase]].

Inline *bold* /italic/ +strike+ _under_ x^2 a_b \\alpha and <2024-01-01 Mon> [cite:@doe2020] [50%].

No label [[relative path]]. Image [[images/picture.SVG][Picture]]. Query [[https://example.test/search?q=one&two=2][Search]].

Labels flatten inline objects: [[https://example.test/label][Text *bold* ~code~ \\alpha]]. Expanded abbreviation [[docs:guide][Documentation]]. Plain https://example.test/plain.

Inline source src_lisp{(+ 1 2)}.

#+BEGIN_NOTE
Special block content.
#+END_NOTE

: Fixed-width text.

\\begin{equation}
x = y
\\end{equation}

#+BEGIN_SRC bad.lang :exports code
invalid-language-tag
#+END_SRC

#+BEGIN_SRC text :exports both
body for both mode
#+END_SRC

#+RESULTS:
: preexisting result

#+BEGIN_SRC text :exports results
body hidden by results mode
#+END_SRC

#+RESULTS:
: preexisting results-only result

#+BEGIN_SRC text :exports none
hidden source and result
#+END_SRC

#+RESULTS:
: hidden result

#+BEGIN: dynamic-name
Dynamic & text
#+END:

-----

#+BEGIN_QUOTE
First\\\\
Second
#+END_QUOTE

#+BEGIN_CENTER
Centered *content*.
#+END_CENTER

#+BEGIN_VERSE
Verse first line
Verse second line
#+END_VERSE

- [-] Partial task
  - Nested item
1. Ordered first
2. Ordered second

| A | B |
|---+---|
| value | |

Anonymous [fn::inline note] and named[fn:complex].

[fn:complex] Definition paragraph
    - nested footnote item
      continuation
"
