   "#+TITLE: Footnotes, macros, and links
#+AUTHOR: Fixture Author
#+DATE: 2024-02-03
#+LANGUAGE: en
#+OPTIONS: toc:2 num:nil
#+MACRO: greet Greetings, $1
#+MACRO: pair $1|$2
#+MACRO: single [$1]

* Overview
{{{greet(reader)}}} with a named footnote[fn:note] and another reference[fn:note].
Macro arguments: {{{pair(one)}}}; extra arguments: {{{single(one,two)}}}.

Safe links: [[https://example.test/path?q=a&b=c][A label with ]( and `backtick` | pipe]] and [[#details][section link]].

Raw HTML-like text in a literal block:

#+begin_example
<em>literal HTML</em>
#+end_example

This line has a tab between these words: before	and after.

* Detail
:PROPERTIES:
:CUSTOM_ID: details
:END:
The local fragment destination is safe.

[fn:note] One definition serves both references.
"
